sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant BS as agora-brainstorm
    participant DR as Dreamers<br/>(5 agents)
    participant SK as specialist-skeptic<br/>(grounding mode)
    participant WR as agora-write-brainstorm-report
    participant FS as File System

    User->>BS: /agora-brainstorm [slug]
    BS->>FS: Read ideas/{slug}/README.md
    FS-->>BS: idea context + existing proposals
    BS->>FS: Count *-brainstorm-* in sessions/
    FS-->>BS: session number

    Note over BS: Print session header<br/>Dreamers · Rounds · Horizon focus

    loop For each round (1 → max_brainstorm_rounds, default 3)
        BS->>BS: Print round header + focus directive<br/>(Round 1: free · Round 2: cross-pollinate · Round 3: sharpen)

        loop For each dreamer (futurist, builder, user-advocate, connector, narrativist)
            BS->>FS: Read dreamer MEMORY.md (if exists)
            FS-->>BS: dreamer memory (or empty)
            BS->>DR: /dreamer-{name} with idea + history + memory + horizon assignment
            DR-->>BS: proposals with horizon tags (quick-win / growth-feature / moonshot)
            BS->>BS: Collect proposals into ALL_PROPOSALS
        end

        alt Round 2 or 3
            BS->>SK: /specialist-skeptic MODE:brainstorm-grounding<br/>with ALL PROPOSALS SO FAR
            SK-->>BS: 2–3 flagged proposals + 2 sharp questions
            BS->>BS: Record SKEPTIC_FLAGS and SKEPTIC_QUESTIONS
        end
    end

    BS->>WR: /agora-write-brainstorm-report (slug, session n, proposals, flags, transcript)
    WR->>FS: Write ideas/{slug}/sessions/{slug}-brainstorm-{n}-{date}.md
    WR-->>BS: filename

    BS->>FS: Update ideas/{slug}/README.md (merge proposals by horizon)
    BS->>FS: Update ideas_index.md (increment Brainstorms count)

    loop For each dreamer
        BS->>DR: /dreamer-{name} MODE:memory-update (contributions + synthesis)
        DR-->>BS: Updated MEMORY.md content
        BS->>FS: Write .claude/skills/dreamer-{name}/MEMORY.md
    end

    BS->>FS: Append to analytics/brainstorms.jsonl
    BS-->>User: Brainstorm complete — proposals summary + strongest picks per horizon
